# QEMU Cortex-M33 virtual board presenting the SF32LB56X chip identity.
#
# Same QEMU machine (mps2-an505) and the same link.lds as every other
# qemu_* board; only the chip identity selected in hcpu/Kconfig.board
# differs. Kept as a separate directory because --board=<name> resolves to
# customer/boards/<name>/hcpu, and because a testcase names its platform by
# board name -- so "which chip is being emulated" has to be readable there.
#
# Console selection (CONSOLE_QEMU) lives in customer/peripherals/console/Kconfig.
